# Project map (Godot 4.x)

- **Combat orchestrator:** `combat/CombatManager.gd` — Node with `combatants`, `event_queue`, signals. Keeps registration, `start()` (seeds **`formation_doctrine`** via **`CombatConstants.encounter_formation_doctrine_string`** on **`encounter`**, then **`CombatConstants.formation_doctrine_string_from_dict`** on each preset dict — **`FORMATION_PRESET_KEY_DOCTRINE`** + **`FORMATION_PRESET_KEY_DOCTRINE_ALT`**, per side), and thin `func` forwards. Loaded via `core/ResourcePaths.gd` → `COMBAT_MANAGER`. Public **`get_health_entity(node)`** for Character→CoreEntity resolution; subsystems use **`CombatantEntityAccess.get_entity_from_manager`** / **`get_health_entity_from_node`**. **`CombatFileKeyedDict`** for int/string file keys in formation breach/wedge dicts.
- **Combat subsystems (preload from manager or call static):** `CombatProcessTick`, `CombatEventScheduler` (**`reschedule_back_rank_turns`** + rank/file snapshots vs **`formation_id_for_zone_geometry`**), `CombatEventDispatch`, `CombatResolveAction`, `CombatEngagementResolver`, `CombatFormationFlow` (intrusion slots + **`intrusion_wedge_by_file`** + vacancy/death plugs + **`on_combatant_died`** host **`slot_obstacles`** / `notify` vs **`formation_id_for_zone_geometry`** + **`reconcile_vacancy_plugs_*`** from `CombatManager.notify_formation_changed` / `get_available_actions`), `CombatIntrusionWedge` (wedge upsert/clear; lane-stress helper), `CombatFormationSetup`, `CombatFormationEngagement` (line cohesion + posture; wedge/breach; LINE↔OPEN hysteresis; calls **`CombatMoraleCohesion`** for `morale_cohesion_factor`), `CombatIntrusionGeometry` (crash neighbor hold on **host** line via **`formation_id_for_zone_geometry`**), `CombatDistanceBands` (**`depth_polearm_lane_open_by_combatant_id`** — harness **`_run_depth_polearm_lane_cache_matches_builder`**), `ZoneOfControl` (**`formation_id_for_zone_geometry`**, **`formation_dict_for_zone_geometry`** — intruder host fid + shared **`formations[fid]`** read for **`assign_combatant_zones`**, **`count_alive_in_zone`** (ZoC fill), ZoC **engagement parry**, **pair distance**, **AI targeting / crash** formation lookups), `TacticalCombat` (lane stress: max(breach_local, wedge)), `BreachResolver`, `FormationBreachRules`, `CombatCombatantsSnapshot` (UI rows), `CombatMedicalCoordination` (retry / parts under treatment), `AttackResolver`, `AvailableActionsBuilder` (`effective_pair_eff_dist`: host geometry + `lane_offset` + wedge pull; **`ordered_melee_opponents`** via **`CombatTargetScoring`**), **`CombatTargetScoring`** (hostile listed weights: doctrine pinch/hold, engagement mode, posture+cohesion, opponent formation, breached-file column (**`opponent_breach_file_targeting_mult`**), stance; intruder-aware via **`formation_id_for_zone_geometry`**), **`CombatDoctrine`** (per-formation doctrine string; automatic pinch pilot), **`CombatAIActionPicker`** (weighted `pick`; crash viability × posture × line cohesion; depth spear stab/cut × doctrine; prunes commitments once per pick), `MedicalPhaseController`, etc. under `combat/`. **`FEATURE_LINE_CRASH_INTRUSION`** in `CombatConstants.gd` (default **false**) gates **new** line-crash intrusions; see `IMPLEMENTATION_ORDER.md` Development gate. **Doc index:** `docs/README.md`. **Implementation plan / milestone status:** `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_ORDER.md` only — **do not** duplicate milestone **Status** text in rules (see that file’s **Milestone summary** under Tier 1). **Tier 1 spec** §4–§6: `docs/ENGAGEMENT_LINE_COHESION_INTRUSION_PLAN.md`.
- **Weapons (abstract impact):** `weapon/WeaponConstants.gd`, `weapon/WeaponDamageHelper.gd`, `weapon/ImpactVelocityModel.gd`, `weapon/WeaponSwingPhysics.gd` — **Tier 3.0** thrust vs swing **`kinematic_delivery`** (plan: `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_ORDER.md` Tier 3 + dependency chain item 12).
- **Tuning:** `combat/CombatConstants.gd` is large by design (single source of numeric constants). **Tier 3.1 strike measure:** `STRIKE_MEASURE_*`, `AvailableActionsBuilder.strike_measure_ratio_for_attack_pair`, `stamp_attack_pair_geometry_on_dict`. **`CombatRegressionHarness`:** `_run_doctrine_normalize_and_manager_roundtrip`, `_run_encounter_formation_doctrine_on_start`, `_run_encounter_formation_doctrine_string_helper`, `_run_ai_targeting_incap_hostile_mult`, `_run_weapon_depth_melee_eligible_fixture`, `_run_depth_polearm_lane_open_false_for_non_eligible_weapon`, `_run_depth_polearm_threatens_line_target_pure_guards`, `_run_depth_polearm_valid_line_threat_false_when_lane_closed`, `_run_depth_polearm_valid_line_threat_agrees_with_threatens_when_lane_open`, `_run_depth_polearm_opp_matches_rank0_agrees_with_valid_line_threat`, `_run_depth_polearm_melee_pair_rank_allowed_agrees_with_valid_line_threat`, `_run_depth_polearm_can_melee_threaten_respects_valid_line_for_home_depth`, `_run_depth_polearm_ai_weight_mult_requires_valid_line_to_any_rank0`, `_run_depth_polearm_lane_open_false_when_intruded`, `_run_depth_polearm_lane_open_false_at_rank_zero`, `_run_depth_polearm_lane_open_false_without_living_same_file_rank0`, `_run_depth_polearm_lane_cache_matches_builder`, `_run_depth_polearm_lane_open_false_when_same_file_rank0_incap`, `_run_depth_polearm_lane_open_zone_geometry_fid_round_trip`, `_run_depth_polearm_allows_low_targets_strict_tight_when_lane_open`, `_run_stamp_attack_pair_geometry_depth_lane_flags_consistent`, `_run_stamp_attack_pair_geometry_depth_defaults_non_depth_attack`, `_run_depth_polearm_parts_filter_tracks_allows_low`, `_run_depth_polearm_parts_filter_wedge_opens_legs_strict_tight`, `_run_depth_polearm_restricted_profile_requires_wedge_for_allows_low`, `_run_depth_polearm_allows_low_formation_dict_cache_matches_null`, `_run_depth_polearm_parts_filter_pass_through_when_no_depth_lane_use`, `_run_depth_polearm_allows_low_assume_skips_closed_lane_guard`, `_run_depth_polearm_allows_low_assume_agrees_when_lane_open`, `_run_depth_polearm_allows_low_zone_geometry_fid_round_trip`, `_run_hostile_pair_distributed_pressure_ally_commit`, `_run_ally_pressure_count_depth_uses_melee_pair_to_defender`, `_run_hostile_pair_cached_engagement_mode_matches_live`, `_run_targeting_file_opposed_mult`, `_run_ordered_melee_opponents_file_opposed_sort`, `_run_targeting_formation_dict_cache_matches_live`, `_run_targeting_hold_lane_off_file_mult`, `_run_targeting_pinch_center_inward_bonus`, `_run_targeting_commitment_match_mult`, `_run_targeting_soft_geometry_eff_dist_formula`, `_run_targeting_prune_expired_doctrine_commitment`, `_run_targeting_prune_commitment_when_target_dies`, `_run_targeting_clear_all_state_for_dead_defender`, `_run_surround_defense_multiplier_from_pa_both_paths`, `_run_surround_live_weight_sum_matches_from_pa_sector_path`, `_run_surround_single_threat_int_and_sector_neutral`, `_run_sector_surround_feature_flag_respects_runtime_toggle`.
- **Entities:** `core/CoreEntity.gd` plus `EntityMedical`, `EntityDamage`, `EntityWounds`, …
- **Battle UI:** `ui/BattleScene.gd`, `BattleUIUpdater.gd`, row/diagram builders under `ui/`.

When adding behavior, extend the **smallest** existing module that owns that concern; avoid growing `CombatManager.gd` beyond orchestration and public API.
